ta-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, רפא ᴵ 1\">רפא ᴵ</a>) with suff. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_◌וּת.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, ◌וּת 1\">◌וּת</a>.]", "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Klein Dictionary", "language": "heb.modern", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "Klein Dictionary", "attribution": "Ezra Klein", "index_title": "Klein Dictionary", "version_title": "Carta Jerusalem; 1st edition, 1987", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "רִפְאוּת", "parent_lexicon": "BDB Dictionary", "content": {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong>n.f. healing;</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.8\">Pr 3:8</a> (fig.)."}]}, "rid": "BDB09480", "strong_numbers": ["7500"], "next_hw": "רְפָאֵל", "prev_hw": "רְפֻאָה", "all_cited": true, "quotes": [], "GK": ["8326"], "TWOT": ["2196b"], "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "BDB Dictionary", "language": "heb.biblical", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "BDB Dictionary", "attribution": "F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs", "index_title": "BDB", "version_title": "A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "רִפְאוּת", "parent_lexicon": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "content": {"definition": ["<p>ש\"נ, — כמו <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Ben_Yehuda_Dictionary,_רְפֻאָה.1\" data-ref=\"Ben Yehuda Dictionary, רְפֻאָה 1\">רְפוּאָה</a>, <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Ben_Yehuda_Dictionary,_רִפּוּי_I.1\" data-ref=\"Ben Yehuda Dictionary, רִפּוּי I 1\">רִפּוּי</a>, דבר מרַפא, Heilung; guérison; healing: רִפְאוּת תהי לשרך ושקוי לעצמותיך (<span class=\"by-source\">משלי ג ח</span>). — ואמר בן סירא: אשר יצלח לו (לרופא) פשרה <strong>ורפאות </strong>למען מחיה (<span class=\"by-source\">ב\"ס, גני' לח יד</span>). — ואמר המשורר: הן לחליי ארכה שלח צור לי <strong>רפאות </strong>(<span class=\"by-source\">ר\"י הלוי, יקרו נסיך, זמורה י, 619</span>). <strong>רפאות </strong>תעלה אין בידנו <span class=\"by-source\">(משלם דאפיאירה, לבי לימים, ידיעות מכון שוקן דת נז)</span><sup class=\"footnote-marker\">1</sup><i class=\"footnote\">[שלש <strong>רפאיות </strong>בדפוסי <span class=\"by-source\">תנחו' תצוה יג</span>, היא ט\"ס במקום דיפראות, כבתנחו' בובר, מו היונ' διφοροϛ, נושא פעמים בשנה, פּוֹרֶה].</i>.</p>"]}, "rid": "BY-19160", "prev_hw": "רְפֻאָה", "next_hw": "רְפָאִים", "page_num": 6673, "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "language": "heb", "to_language": "heb", "text_categories": [], "index_title": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "version_title": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "version_lang": "he", "should_autocomplete": true}}]